{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/0e44c72b9d52c01cd974efe134663957.poster.avif?t=1725109211\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/0e44c72b9d52c01cd974efe134663957.webm?t=1725109211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/0e44c72b9d52c01cd974efe134663957.mp4?t=1725109211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2>10 fighters from all walks of life come together once again for a classic handheld game style brawl! Connect attacks to build your gauge, then press B repeatedly to perform &quot;DANDAN&quot; Combos and unleash a variety of other special moves to gain victory over your opponents! <br><br>The sixth game in the  <strong>Game Buddy</strong> series that strives to faithfully recreates the look, sounds, and feel of classic late 80's handheld games in a way that's like experiencing an alternate timeline of gaming history.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/56814b4fdb7f45be9255a9fc494236eb.avif?t=1725109211\" width=300 height=94 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/b553f34d4c169273f6e6d733138526eb.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Sanshiro:</strong> The fighting vocational school student. He decided to follow the path of martial arts to emulate a strong fighter he admired.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/1397148e7dd6cdd1612b14cc7e88f66e.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Jacky Tayama:</strong> Deciple of Shiburi Kempo. He spends his days training so he can beat his rival Sanshiro.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/e34a04e0ffa77952d1c3d9bb8b577caf.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Hikaru Bakuenryu: </strong> A girl who has mastered Bakuen Karate. She joined the fight to search for a boyfriend stronger than her.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/7b4077c3466536f33807127e6e28c272.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Patrick:</strong> Sells exercise equipment on a TV shopping channel. Works on his abs to try and win the heart of Maki, his on-air sales partner.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/fa00e199b3b5fa894d3e9c2fbb222b40.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Inaba Man:</strong> Sanshiro's teacher from his school. He may not look like a teacher with his rugged face, but he's hot blooded and hates when you mess with his hair or disrupt his class.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/74f7839ca3f3de9ec74463bed6fe1082.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Joe Afro:</strong> The strongest mosquito-weight boxer around. He left the boxing world when he realized his hair put him in a different weight class.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/00d2545562179b24c58108be7b65938c.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Maxi Psycho:</strong> A psychic who battles evil but has a tendency to take things too far. Has destroyed several cities in her fights.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/079ce3ecf9c52a781436b06a7bbd6097.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Osamu Iwata:</strong> Everyone knows he's a nerd. Wears a homemade battle suit and transforms into Sabre Cross.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/cc1e1e68ecb5f532e98a98e640b480d6.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Kouji Yokoyama:</strong> The self-proclaimed strongest delinquent. Continually fights to prove that he is in fact the strongest guy in town.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/2d416d80de3831a9e9a96f8ce1fe2323.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Mohigan:</strong> The mysterious creature that lives on Mohigan Island. His daily life is depicted in the T.V. Show, &quot;Mohigan's Daily Life&quot;.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game-play</h2>Each characters arsenal of moves includes throws, specials, SUPER specials, and DANDAN combos. Beat down your opponent to build your gauge, and then make them taste the pain! <br><br>Progress through each character's story mode, challenge your friends in local hot-seat multiplayer, or hit up the practice room to perfect your favorite character's combos!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story mode, arcade mode, 2 player versus mode, and practice mode.<br></li><li>10 unique fighters with all their own specials and moves<br></li><li>8-bit sights and sounds that faithfully emulates the early era of handheld gaming.<br></li><li>Catchy and nostalgic chiptune music.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to access the menu</h2><strong>To access the game menu and manual, press select button on gamepad or shift key on keyboard.</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2729430?t=1725109211","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2729430?t=1725109211","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1725109211","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1725109211","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/0e44c72b9d52c01cd974efe134663957.poster.avif?t=1725109211\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/0e44c72b9d52c01cd974efe134663957.webm?t=1725109211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/0e44c72b9d52c01cd974efe134663957.mp4?t=1725109211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2>10 fighters from all walks of life come together once again for a classic handheld game style brawl! Connect attacks to build your gauge, then press B repeatedly to perform &quot;DANDAN&quot; Combos and unleash a variety of other special moves to gain victory over your 