span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/fa00e199b3b5fa894d3e9c2fbb222b40.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Inaba Man:</strong> Sanshiro's teacher from his school. He may not look like a teacher with his rugged face, but he's hot blooded and hates when you mess with his hair or disrupt his class.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/74f7839ca3f3de9ec74463bed6fe1082.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Joe Afro:</strong> The strongest mosquito-weight boxer around. He left the boxing world when he realized his hair put him in a different weight class.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/00d2545562179b24c58108be7b65938c.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Maxi Psycho:</strong> A psychic who battles evil but has a tendency to take things too far. Has destroyed several cities in her fights.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/079ce3ecf9c52a781436b06a7bbd6097.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Osamu Iwata:</strong> Everyone knows he's a nerd. Wears a homemade battle suit and transforms into Sabre Cross.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/cc1e1e68ecb5f532e98a98e640b480d6.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Kouji Yokoyama:</strong> The self-proclaimed strongest delinquent. Continually fights to prove that he is in fact the strongest guy in town.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/extras/2d416d80de3831a9e9a96f8ce1fe2323.avif?t=1725109211\" width=64 height=64 /></span><br><strong>Mohigan:</strong> The mysterious creature that lives on Mohigan Island. His daily life is depicted in the T.V. Show, &quot;Mohigan's Daily Life&quot;.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game-play</h2>Each characters arsenal of moves includes throws, specials, SUPER specials, and DANDAN combos. Beat down your opponent to build your gauge, and then make them taste the pain! <br><br>Progress through each character's story mode, challenge your friends in local hot-seat multiplayer, or hit up the practice room to perfect your favorite character's combos!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story mode, arcade mode, 2 player versus mode, and practice mode.<br></li><li>10 unique fighters with all their own specials and moves<br></li><li>8-bit sights and sounds that faithfully emulates the early era of handheld gaming.<br></li><li>Catchy and nostalgic chiptune music.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to access the menu</h2><strong>To access the game menu and manual, press select button on gamepad or shift key on keyboard.</strong>","developers":["RETSUZAN"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729430/header.jpg?t=1725109211","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2729430/649939/e58cd48bb0546340b0d37796bedd1b9fabc36fe7/1750894901/dash_av1.mpd?t=1707480344","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2729430/649939/e58cd48bb0546340b0d37796bedd